/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 15\">15</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_16\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 16\">16</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_17\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 17\">17</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_18\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 18\">18</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_19\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 19\">19</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">20</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 21\">21</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_22\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 22\">22</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 23\">23</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_24\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 24\">24</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_25\" title=\"2018 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 25\">25</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AMC_10_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AMC 10 Problems and Solutions\"> All AMC 10 Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B\">2018 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2018 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2018 AMC 12